Package: VisitationR
Title: Estimate Pollinator Visitation Rates from Seed Set Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Ignasi", "Bartomeus",
           , "nachobartomeus@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
    )
Description: Fits biologically realistic saturating (Michaelis-Menten type) models
    that link the number of pollinator visits to the resulting seed set in a 
    plant population. The package provides tools to fit the model to empirical 
    data, to mechanistically calculate the model from basic parameters, and to 
    calculate the number of visits required to reach a given proportion of the maximum seed
    set.
